WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.815
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: What AI Can Do for You.

2
00:00:06.115 --> 00:00:12.645
See five useful things an AI assistant can do today. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:21.973
Step one. An AI assistant can write. It helps with emails, letters and ideas. You give a task, and it gives a first draft.

4
00:00:22.983 --> 00:00:27.658
Step two. It can summarise. Give it a long text, and it makes it short.

5
00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:34.057
Step three. It can translate and fix your English. It shows the corrected sentence.

6
00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:44.096
Step four. It can plan. Ask for a study plan or a daily schedule. Remember: AI is a helper. You check and decide.

7
00:00:45.083 --> 00:00:48.873
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:49.173 --> 00:00:51.753
Write down three tasks you do each week.

9
00:00:52.053 --> 00:00:55.179
Choose one task that AI could help with.

10
00:00:55.479 --> 00:00:57.049
Try it in the next lesson.

11
00:00:57.349 --> 00:00:58.408
Well done!

